ras/1de2ced47770dbea4071ca5b72f8095e.poster.avif?t=1711897751\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870900/extras/1de2ced47770dbea4071ca5b72f8095e.webm?t=1711897751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870900/extras/1de2ced47770dbea4071ca5b72f8095e.mp4?t=1711897751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The bottom center screen uses W, Up, LeftShift, and Space.<br><br>You can rotate under zoom as shown in the screenshot above,<br><br>For rotation, you can change the rotation speed by opening the settings.<br>And this is an important fact.<br><br>The last game I looked at<br><strong>50+ maps</strong>.",
